strings.en:
{0c:28001000}{10}, it's all yours. I pass on
anything that's a pain. I mean, there's no
reward, right?{0c:020601}

{0c:28001000}It is all yours, {10}-san. Ah, what
splendid work. How I envy you.{1a}Me...? I shall decline, thank you. Errands
are underlings' work. They hardly suit me.{0c:020301}

